]

DEMO STEPS (tween through these using goToStep(); each step drives the controls above):
[
  {
    "title": "The hidden lattice",
    "narration": "Only the white state nodes and their grid edges are shown: every site is coupled to its four nearest neighbors, and the edges run off the frame because the field is unbounded.",
